1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:02,910
“Maa! I got promoted… Team Lead!”

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:06,145
Maa didn't even look up: “Okay…
eat your paratha.”

3
00:00:06,145 --> 00:00:10,525
Indian mom love never says “proud
of you”… So what does it say?

4
00:00:10,525 --> 00:00:12,507
Yashoda knew the answer.

5
00:00:12,507 --> 00:00:15,271
Balarama: “Maa, Kanha ate mud!”

6
00:00:15,271 --> 00:00:17,306
Yashoda: “Open your mouth!”

7
00:00:17,306 --> 00:00:22,906
Inside that tiny mouth… the whole
universe. Sun, moon, stars…

8
00:00:22,906 --> 00:00:24,786
and Yashoda herself.

9
00:00:24,786 --> 00:00:26,878
Back home, Ishaan was still upset.

10
00:00:26,878 --> 00:00:29,278
The Lord spread over her His maya…

11
00:00:29,278 --> 00:00:31,271
made of love for her son.

12
00:00:31,341 --> 00:00:36,210
Putra-sneh: love for her son. And
she lifted Kanha into her lap.

13
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:39,738
She had seen the whole universe…
and stayed just his mother.

14
00:00:39,738 --> 00:00:44,026
It was Ahoi Ashtami. Maa had
fasted all day, no water, for him.

15
00:00:44,026 --> 00:00:46,369
Ishaan brought her
water: “Thank you, Maa.”

16
00:00:46,369 --> 00:00:48,793
Maa smiled: “Okay…
have you eaten?”

17
00:00:48,793 --> 00:00:51,388
What does your mom say?
Tell us in the comments.
